    <statement><p>Calculate the flux of the vector field
<m>\vec{F}(x,y,z) = 8 \vec{i} + 4 \vec{j} + z \vec{k}</m> 
through the closed circular cylinder of 
radius <m>6</m> centered about the z-axis for 
<m>-7 \leq z \leq 7</m>, oriented away from the 
z-axis.  Note: a closed cylinder has a top and a bottom.</p>
<p>Flux = 
<m>\displaystyle \iint\limits_S \vec{F} \cdot d\vec{A}</m> =
<fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>14\pi \cdot 6^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
